# Real financial data. This repo is public, and this file bypasses every gate
# (?dev=1 loads it without any Google check) - it must never be pushed.
dev-data.xlsx
dev-data.json


# The OAuth client download from Google Cloud. It carries a client_secret,
# which this app never uses (the implicit token flow has no secret) - so in a
# public repo it is pure liability with no upside. The client id itself is
# public and lives in js/config.js; this file should be deleted once the id has
# been copied out of it.
client_secret_*.json

